  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xF6;det genom Kvinna till Kvinna &#xE4;r f&#xF6;r att st&#xE4;rka lokalal kvinnoorganisationer i Serbien, och f&#xF6;r att kunna bidra till &#xF6;kad j&#xE4;mst&#xE4;lldhet i det serbiska samh&#xE4;llet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the programme is to strengthen women&apos;s movement and contribute to the democratisation of the society by advocating for respect of women&apos;s human rights. It is implemented through 6 priority areas (women in the peace process, women&apos;s organising, women&apos;s human rights, women&apos;s participation in decision making, women&apos;s work against GBV and women&apos;s health. Done in coop. with local CSOs.</narrative>
  </description>
